ldm-unraid: ldm-unraid (Windows dynamic disks for Unraid)
ldm-unraid:
ldm-unraid: Reads Windows dynamic disk (LDM) volumes: simple, spanned, striped
ldm-unraid: and mirrored, on MBR or GPT disks. Volumes are assembled with
ldm-unraid: device-mapper, mounted under /mnt/disks (read-only by default) and
ldm-unraid: can be shared over SMB. Includes the ldmctl command-line tool.
